| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **GL-BRAND-01** | Three names: باشگاه / Portal / denali | Portal + marketing chrome fallbacks | **1** | All three surfaces show the same `displayName`. Empty → `defaultSiteName` only. Never `pluginId` or `"Portal"`. Specs: chrome unit + branding public GET. |
| **GL-BRAND-02** | Club is not named shenski | Operator settings + optional Denali club seed/ensure `…000003` | **1** | Admin Save `shenski` on `/settings/branding` (or idempotent club seed). Hard refresh marketing + login + `/me` all say **shenski**. Smoke `…014` unchanged. |
| **GL-PHONE-01** | After logout, login field is `+15550009901` | `initialPublicRegistrationPhone()` in development | **2** | Club guest login (`denali.localhost` / portal.denali) does not look pre-filled with the US smoke number. Sending OTP without editing the field must not create/login a different user. |
| **GL-PHONE-02** | OTP «تغییر شماره» restores `+15550009901` | `catalog-registration-auth-steps.tsx` change-phone merge | **2** | Change-phone clears to empty (or last typed club number), not `PUBLIC_REGISTRATION_DEV_PHONE`. |
| **GL-AVATAR-01** | Profile has two «انتخاب تصویر» controls | Hidden file input + button share `aria-label` | **3** | One named upload control; file input is visually hidden and not a second button in the a11y tree. |
| **GL-OTP-01** | OTP cells labelled `Digit 1`…; extra unnamed textbox | `otp-segment-input.tsx` autofill sink + English aria-label | **4** | Autofill sink stays out of a11y tree; cell labels use i18n (FA/EN). Dev hint `کد توسعه: 1234` may stay in `NODE_ENV=development`. |
| **GL-POLISH-01** | `GET /favicon.ico` 404 on portal | Portal app metadata / public asset | **5** | No 404 for favicon on `portal.denali.localhost`. |
| **GL-POLISH-02** | Next.js LCP warning on marketing hero image | Marketing image `priority` | **5** | Hero/LCP img has `priority` (or equivalent). Not a login blocker. |

## Phase order

```text
0  this contract (no code)
1  GL-BRAND-01 + GL-BRAND-02   settings SoT + shenski on club chrome
2  GL-PHONE-01 + GL-PHONE-02   login phone traps (wrong-account risk)
3  GL-AVATAR-01                profile upload a11y
4  GL-OTP-01                   OTP a11y
5  GL-POLISH-01 + GL-POLISH-02 favicon + LCP (optional last)
```

Do **not** put `shenski` on `resolveDefaultTenantBranding("denali")`. Guest chrome and phone traps land together so the club name is visible before login.

## Non-goals

| Item | Why |
| --- | --- |
| Rename plugin id `denali` | Workspace type / WRS host, not the club trade name |
| Unpublish / lifecycle | Unrelated |
| ×10 toman or persist ghosts | Closed in Asklim pack |
| Hardcode `shenski` in `apps/marketing` or `apps/portal` | Name is tenant settings, not a string in the guest apps |
| Full monorepo gates | Fast-track only until Architect YES |

## Verification (when a phase starts)

- Fast-track: targeted portal/marketing specs + `guard:import-boundary`. No `phase-5:gate` / `test:full`.
- Manual: `denali.admin.localhost:3000/settings/branding` → Save **shenski** → hard refresh `denali.localhost:3002` + `portal.denali.localhost:3003/login` + `/me/profile`.
- Logout → header **ورود** → login with `09128881147` must not show a filled US number.

